{"id":1169,"level":72,"name":"Прохідні пішаки","group":"Пішакова майстерність","format":27,"description":"A <em>passed pawn</em> is a pawn on its way to promotion with no opposing pawns to stop it. A passed pawn forms a major threat. Once it has crossed the board, it can change into a queen.<br /><br />It is often possible to combine the threat of a pawn promotion with other motives, like double attacks or pins. Sometimes it even makes sense to sacrifice a piece, if this opens the way to promotion for a passed pawn.<br /><br /><strong>What do you have to do?</strong><br />In this exercise, you always have a passed pawn on its way to promotion. Look for another forcing move to pile up threats, like a double attack or a sacrifice. Use this combination to win material.","assignment":"","stickerID":62,"examples":[{"fen":"2b2k2/5pp1/1n1P3p/8/8/6P1/5PKP/2R5 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yd6]} 1. Rxc8+ Nxc8 2. d7 {[%cal Yd7c8,Yd7d8]} 1-0","text":"<p>Поки що прохідний пішак заблоковано, але білі можуть змінити це красивою жертвою тури!</p>","format":27},{"fen":"5k2/2P2pp1/3np2p/8/8/5BP1/5PKP/8 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal Yc7c8]} 1. Bb7 $1 Nxb7 (1... Ke7 2. c8=Q Nxc8 3. Bxc8) 2. c8=Q+ 1-0","text":"<p>Білі хотіли б перетворити пішака, але чорні закрили поле перетворення. Однак білі можуть досягти прогресу, гарно пожертвувавши слона.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"5R2/2k3r1/4P3/8/8/8/2K5/8 w - - 0 0","pgn":"{[%csl Yc7,Yg7]} 1. Rf7+ Rxf7 2. exf7 Kd7 3. f8=Q 1-0","text":"","format":27},{"fen":"2b5/Pk3pp1/7p/1B6/8/6P1/5PKP/8 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Ya7,Rc8]} 1. Ba6+ Kxa7 (1... Kxa6 2. a8=Q+) 2. Bxc8 1-0","text":"<p>Чорний слон і король знаходяться на одному діафоналі. Білі виграють від цього з<strong> 1.Ba6+!</strong>. Якщо чорні беруть слона, пішак підвищується, але якщо чорні беруть пішака, білі виграють фігуру.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"5k2/8/2Pn4/8/8/8/2K2B2/8 w - - 0 0","pgn":"{[%csl Yd6,Yf8]} 1. Bc5 Ke7 2. c7 Kd7 3. Bxd6 1-0","text":"<p>Білі хотіли б перетворити пішака, але кінь захищає поле перетворення. Після того, як білі забивають коня першим ходом, кінь не може виконувати своє завдання захисту, і білі можуть форсувати виграшний ендшпіль.</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":41372,"fen":"6k1/1p1q2pp/p2Pr1b1/3Q1p2/P3p2P/6P1/1P3PK1/3R4 w - - 0 1","pgn":"1. Qxe6+ Qxe6 2. d7 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41335,"fen":"8/4n1P1/p3k3/Pp1p3p/1P5B/2K5/8/8 w - - 0 1","pgn":"1. Bxe7 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41329,"fen":"6k1/8/1n2p1pp/1bPpP1B1/p2P2P1/8/5PK1/3B4 w - - 0 1","pgn":"1. cxb6 (1. Bxh6?   Nc4) 1... Bc6 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41330,"fen":"5r2/RP6/3p2p1/2pkp3/8/2K2P2/1P6/8 w - - 0 1","pgn":"1. Ra8 Rxa8 2. bxa8=Q+ 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41336,"fen":"8/4k3/8/8/7p/8/P5r1/1K3R2 b - - 0 1","pgn":"1... h3 2. Rh1 h2 3. a4 Rg1+ 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41362,"fen":"r6k/7p/1p4p1/1Rb1p3/2Bp4/p2P1PP1/4P2P/4K3 b - - 0 1","pgn":"1... a2 2. Bxa2 Rxa2 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41360,"fen":"7k/pp2r1pp/8/2p5/2P2P2/3p4/PPP3PP/2R3K1 b - - 0 1","pgn":"1... d2 2. Rd1 Re1+ 3. Kf2 Rxd1 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41319,"fen":"5b1k/1b1n3p/1p1PN1p1/4p3/2q5/4P2P/3Q2P1/3R3K w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yd7]} 1. Nxf8 Nxf8 2. d7 Nxd7 3. Qxd7 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":45300,"fen":"5k2/2P2pp1/3np2p/8/8/5BP1/5PKP/8 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal Yc7c8]} 1. Bb7 ! Nxb7 (1... Ke7 2. c8=Q Nxc8 3. Bxc8) 2. c8=Q+ 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":50239,"fen":"2k5/P7/6pP/5pP1/3bbP2/2Bp4/PK6/8 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal Gd3d1]} 1... d2 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41321,"fen":"5k1r/2R5/p1P2p2/3BnP1p/6p1/8/P7/1K6 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal 